# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/Host/
**/Release/
**/Debug/

# LiteDB and SQLite databases
**/*.litedb
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-shm
**/*.sqlite-wal
identity.db

# Logs
**/logs/

# Downloadable POS app builds (Mercurius.Mobile/publish-downloads.ps1) — ~100 MB each, far too big
# for git; served by DownloadsController and shipped by publishing from the machine that built them.
Mercurius/Downloads/

# Uploaded runtime files
**/wwwroot/ProductImages/*.png
**/wwwroot/ProductImages/*.jpg
**/wwwroot/ProductImages/*.jpeg

# Temp / scratch
**/_ul
**/_ul-*
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.log

# Test run output (dotnet test --logger trx)
**/TestResults/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/

# Secrets — real credentials for the live deployment. Never committed to this public repo.
# appsettings.json in git keeps blank/placeholder values; appsettings.Production.json holds
# the real ones locally and is picked up by `dotnet publish` from disk without ever being tracked.
**/appsettings.Production.json
*.PublishSettings
ADMIN_DATA_QUERY_ACCESS.md

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Package caches
**/.nuget/